entries[171159] = { ["name"] = "Design: Uncanny Combatant's Intuitive Staff", ["text"] = "Rank 2\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft Uncanny Combatant's Intuitive Staff more efficiently.\nReduce the materials required to craft an Uncanny Combatant's Intuitive Staff.\nRequires Kul Tiran Jewelcrafting (1)\nSell Price:\nUncanny Combatant's Intuitive Staff\nBinds when equipped\nTwo-Hand Staff\n7 - 11 Damage Speed 3.60\n(2.5 damage per second)\n+30 Intellect\n+10 Stamina\nDurability 120 / 120\nSell Price:\nRequires Sage Agate (15), Azsharine (15), Osmenite Ore (30), Storm Silver Ore (17), Expulsom (4)" }
